TITLE:: ChaosOsc
categories:: UGens>Generators
summary:: Logistic-map chaotic oscillator.

DESCRIPTION::
ChaosOsc generates a deterministic chaotic signal using a logistic map. It is
provided by the ChaosOsc server plugin and produces an audio-rate signal in
the range -1 to 1.

The constructor is ::ChaosOsc.ar(chaosAmount, seed)::.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: ar
Create an audio-rate chaotic oscillator.

ARGUMENT:: chaosAmount
The logistic-map growth rate, clamped by the plugin to the range 3.57 to 3.999.
Defaults to 3.9. The input is read for every sample and can be modulated at
audio rate.

ARGUMENT:: seed
The initial map state, normally in the open interval 0 to 1. Defaults to 0.5.
The seed is captured when the Synth is created; changing the input afterward
does not reseed the oscillator.

RETURNS::
An audio-rate UGen.

EXAMPLES::

code::
{
    var signal = ChaosOsc.ar(3.9, 0.37);
    (signal * 0.1) ! 2
}.play;
::
